+### Circuit and formula gadgets (registered 2026-11-16, GSW phase 6a, P6-Q6)
+
+`policy.md` §1 (**Construction reuse**) gives circuit construction one shared home and a registry, like
+the machine catalog. Its first rows are the formula-arithmetic layer over `BoolCircuit.TreeCircuit`, in
+`TCSlib/Complexity/CircuitComplexity/FormulaArith/` (facade `FormulaArith.lean`). New formulas are
+assembled from these rows; a gadget that almost exists is commissioned here, not re-derived. Depths are
+the published bounds (`D` = the inputs' depth; `max 1 D` where a constant `node b []`, depth 1, may pad).
+Status: `balanced` is proved (owner-side O1); every other row is a statement-phase target (Gate 45) for the
+6a fills U8–U11. Leaf gadgets, not hosts (§14's rule does not apply).
+
+| Gadget | File | Contract | Depth |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `TreeCircuit.balanced b cs` | `Combinators.lean` | the unbounded `b`-gate as a balanced fan-in-2 tree: `balanced_eval`, `maxFanin_balanced_le` (`≤ max 2 (maxFaninL cs)`), `size_balanced_le` (`≤ sumSize cs + |cs| + 1`); readers `balanced_nil`, `balanced_singleton` | `≤ maxDepth cs + ⌈log₂ |cs|⌉ + 1` (`depth_balanced_le`) |
+| `TreeCircuit.neg c` | `Combinators.lean` | De Morgan negation (literals flip sign, nodes flip kind): `neg_eval` (`!c.eval x`), `maxFanin_neg` | `= c.depth` (`depth_neg`) |
+| `TreeCircuit.subst c f`, `rename c e` | `Combinators.lean` | substitution of formulas for variables (a negative literal becomes `(f i).neg`): `subst_eval`, `maxFanin_subst_le`; `rename` is the literal case, `rename_eval` | `≤ c.depth + sup_i (f i).depth` (`depth_subst_le`); `rename` preserves depth (`depth_rename`) |
+| `TreeCircuit.const b`, `and2`, `or2` | `Combinators.lean` | constant (`node b []`) and binary `∧`/`∨`: `const_eval`, `and2_eval`, `or2_eval`; fan-in `≤ 2` | `const`: 1; `and2`, `or2`: `+1` |
+| `TreeCircuit.xor2`, `xor3`, `maj3` | `Combinators.lean` | `a ⊕ b`, `a ⊕ b ⊕ c`, majority `a ∧ b ∨ c ∧ (a ⊕ b)`: `xor2_eval`, `xor3_eval`, `maj3_eval`; fan-in `≤ 2` | `+2`, `+4`, `+3` |
+| `FormulaArith.csaStep A B C` | `CarrySave.lean` | one 3:2 carry-save layer (`S` bitwise `xor3`, `K` shifted `maj3`): `csaStep_val` (`val A + val B + val C = val S + val K`, `val x U = bitsVal (U.map (·.eval x))`, `Adder.lean`); `maxFaninL_csaStep_le` | `≤ max 1 D + 4` (`depth_csaStep_le`) |
+| `FormulaArith.csaReduce Us` | `CarrySave.lean` | `csaLevels |Us|` layers of `csaLayer` down to two numbers: `csaReduce_val` (sum preserved); `maxFaninL_csaReduce_le`; `csaLevels_le` (`csaLevels k ≤ 2⌈log₂ k⌉`) | `≤ max 1 D + 4 · csaLevels |Us|` (`depth_csaReduce_le`) |
+| `FormulaArith.carryOut U W b` | `Compare.lean` | generate/propagate carry into position `b` of `U + W`: `carryOut_eval` (`= carryBit (bitAt x U) (bitAt x W) b`, `Adder.lean`), `carryOut_eval_le` (`= decide (2^b ≤ val U + val W)` when `|U|, |W| ≤ b`); fan-in `≤ 2` | `≤ max 1 D + 2⌈log₂ b⌉ + 3` (`depth_carryOut_le`) |
+| `FormulaArith.geConst U W c` | `Compare.lean` | comparison with a constant: `geConst_eval` (`= decide (c ≤ val U + val W)`); fan-in `≤ 2` | `≤ max 1 D + 2⌈log₂ (max |U| |W| + 1)⌉ + 7`, independent of `c` (`depth_geConst_le`) |
+| `FormulaArith.modSumInterval a q lo hi` | `ModSum.lean` | the modular interval sum on `M` inputs: `modSumInterval_eval` (`= decide (lo ≤ S % q ∧ S % q < hi)`, `S = Σ (x i).toNat · a i`, for `a i < q`, `lo ≤ hi ≤ q`) [BV11, Lemma 4.5; BV14, Prop 3.4]; fan-in `≤ 2` | `≤ modSumDepth M q ≤ 9⌈log₂ M⌉ + 2⌈log₂(⌈log₂ q⌉ + ⌈log₂ M⌉ + 3)⌉ + 21` (`depth_modSumInterval_le`, `modSumDepth_le`); no term linear in `log q` |
